  "source": "mcweed mined1: 'Silent assumptions persisted across revisions because nothing forced them to be stated (print orientation x5 revs, thermistor package, standing-vs-lying, user visible)'. Print orientation came out at U18 after five geometry revisions, the 0.2 mm nozzle at U83 after four. Each was a fact the user held and the model guessed around.",
